  "id": "diffusion-process",
  "term": "diffusion process",
  "definition": "A diffusion process is the way knowledge or information spreads through a network of people, groups, or places by means of their communication links. In this context, it refers to how educational messages, experiences, and insights move among tourism sites, visitors, and the wider public.",
